        <li>Access to <strong>software updates</strong> and <strong>customer support</strong> for as long as your licence is active.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Your licence key is tied to your account. While the GPL governs the code itself, access to
        our update service, licence keys, and support is provided only to customers with an active
        licence, and may be suspended for breach of these Terms, chargebacks, or fraud.
      </p>

