        <li>Share, resell, or sublicense your licence key to obtain updates or support for others.</li>
        <li>Misrepresent the origin of the Product or remove required attributions.</li>
        <li>Use the Product to break the law, infringe rights, or distribute malware.</li>
        <li>Attempt to disrupt or gain unauthorised access to our licensing or payment systems.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Pricing &amp; payment</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>All prices are in <strong>US dollars (USD)</strong> unless stated otherwise, and may change over time. The price you pay is the price shown at checkout.</li>
