        <li>Prices may be exclusive of taxes; any applicable taxes are your responsibility unless shown at checkout.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. Refunds</h2>
      <p>
        We offer a <strong>14-day money-back guarantee</strong> on first-time purchases. If the
        Product doesn't work for you, email
        <a href="mailto:support@asteriscommerce.com">support@asteriscommerce.com</a> within 14 days
